  "title": "第三期主軸－模組化",
  "sections": [
    {
      "id": "issues",
      "title": "現況課題",
      "paragraphs": [
        {
          "id": "source-s4-shape19-p1",
          "text": "設施佈設位置是否合理？",
          "shapeId": "19"
        },
        {
          "id": "source-s4-shape19-p2",
          "text": "停止線符合設置規定，但視距不足",
          "shapeId": "19"
        },
        {
          "id": "source-s4-shape22-p1",
          "text": "各個設施的作用是否清楚？",
          "shapeId": "22"
        },
        {
          "id": "source-s4-shape22-p2",
          "text": "我國以「停」標字為主的停管制設計方式是否適當？",
          "shapeId": "22"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "cause",
      "title": "問題根源",
      "paragraphs": [
        {
          "id": "source-s4-shape26-p1",
          "text": "現行規範偏向規定「設施如何設」，較少說明「哪些設施應共同運作、各自扮演什麼功能」。",
          "shapeId": "26"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "goals",
      "title": "模組化目標",
      "paragraphs": [
        {
          "id": "source-s4-shape37-p1",
          "text": "功能分工",
          "shapeId": "37"
        },
        {
          "id": "source-s4-shape39-p1",
          "text": "各設施負責什麼",
          "shapeId": "39"
        },
        {
          "id": "source-s4-shape41-p1",
          "text": "＋",
          "shapeId": "41"
        },
        {
          "id": "source-s4-shape45-p1",
          "text": "組合關係",
          "shapeId": "45"
        },
        {
          "id": "source-s4-shape47-p1",
          "text": "為何如此搭配",
          "shapeId": "47"
        },
        {
          "id": "source-s4-shape49-p1",
          "text": "由「單一設施」轉向\n「完整管制功能」設計",
          "shapeId": "49"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
